    echr:hasSupportingQuote "On 15 May 2018 the Kyiv District Administrative Court resumed the examination of the applicant’s appeal lodged on 5 October 2016... On 8 April 2021 the Kyiv District Administrative Court found that all the decisions issued by the self-government bodies of the Bar against the applicant had been lawful."^^xsd:string .

